						 <blockquote> <p>SCP-WOW-J was initially contained on March 2nd, 1999, following the manifestation of SCP-WOW-J-583829, a deep-fried giraffe scrotum 2.76 million light-years in diameter, two meters from the surface of Earth.</p> </blockquote> <p>Well, that must've been quite catastrophic for Earth&#8230; and the entire galaxy, for that matter.</p> <blockquote> <p>The Foundation is sending probes to determine if SCP-WOW-583829 is tasty at all.</p> </blockquote> <p>I can't. I can't even. +1</p> 
				 	]]>
